        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Green box: the module that owns the rule (Reservations).&lt;br&gt;White box: a module's public contract.&lt;br&gt;Purple dashed box: internal code - only its own module, main.py and the tests may name it.&lt;br&gt;Dashed arrow, open head: a code dependency (an import or a type name).&lt;br&gt;Red dashed arrow: forbidden - tests/test_architecture.py and lint-imports fail if it appears (P06 Step 7)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
